      "sourceTextSha256": "1d748e746236ee5688d451b7821ae32862107ab7b09d1e706eb866846a7be313",
      "text": "A five-day expedition cruise through Patagonia, from Chilean Punta Arenas to Argentine Ushuaia, across some of the most remote and wild landscapes on the planet. On board an expedition vessel offering exceptional comfort, navigate a labyrinth of islands, visit shimmering blue glaciers guarding the southern reaches of the Tierra del Fuego archipelago, sail the Beagle Channel and reach legendary Cape Horn. Shore excursions by zodiac and on foot bring you close to the remarkable wildlife of these waters.",
